{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41377","headline":"句 · 熊皎","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山前犹见月，陌上未逢人。\n果熟秋先落，禽寒夜未栖。\n深逢野草皆爲药，静见樵人恐是仙。\n厌听啼鸟梦醒後，慵扫落花春尽时。\n废土有人耕不畏，古厅无讼醉何妨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"熊皎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41377.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41377","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}